



:: eli_desk
<<nobr>>
<<set $locationImage to "images/locations/eli_desk.jpeg">>
<<set $locationName to "Eli's Desk">>
<<set $right_sidebar_mode to 1>>

<img src="images/locations/eli_desk.jpeg" alt="Eli's Desk" class="location-image">

<<if $day == 1 and $day_step == 1>>
[[Stream|day_1_2]] |
<<elseif $day == 1 and $day_step == 9>>
[[Stream|day_1_10]] |
<<elseif $day == 2 and $day_step == 2>>
[[Stream|day_2_3]] |
<<elseif $day == 2 and $day_step == 21>>
[[Stream|day_2_22_other]] |
<<elseif $day == 3 and $day_step == 27>>
[[Stream|day_3_28_kira]] |
<<elseif $day == 3 and $day_step == 10>>
[[Stream|day_3_11_other]] |
<<elseif $day == 4 and $day_step == 2>>
[[Stream|day_4_3_kira]]
<<elseif $day == 4 and $day_step == 17>>
[[Stream|day_4_18_kira]]

<<else>>
    <<if $route is "kira">>
        <<if $day == 5 and $day_step == 2>>
        [[Stream|day_5_3_kira]]
        <<elseif $day == 5 and $day_step == 18>>
        [[Stream|day_5_19_kira]]
        <</if>>
    <<elseif $route is "other">>
        <<if $day == 5 and $day_step == 2>>
        [[Stream|day_5_3_other]]
        <<elseif $day == 5 and $day_step == 18>>
        [[Stream|day_5_19_other]]
        <</if>>
    <</if>>
<</if>>
[[Listen to Music|desk_music]] | [[Watch Movie|desk_movie]] | [[← Back to Apartment|apartment_map]]
<</nobr>>

:: desk_music

<<set $rand to random(1, 6)>>
<<if $rand is 1>>
<<goto desk_music_1>>
<<elseif $rand is 2>>
<<goto desk_music_2>>
<<elseif $rand is 3>>
<<goto desk_music_3>>
<<elseif $rand is 4>>
<<goto desk_music_4>>
<<elseif $rand is 5>>
<<goto desk_music_5>>
<<else>>
<<goto desk_music_6>>
<</if>>

:: desk_music_1

<img src="images/locations/eli_desk.jpeg" alt="Eli's Desk" class="location-image">

I pull up a playlist I haven't touched in a while. Something slow, low-fi, the kind of stuff that fills a room without demanding attention. I lean back in the chair and let it run. The monitor glows in front of me, idle.

<<eli "...forgot I had this.">>

It's good. I don't do anything else. I just let it play.

[[← Desk|eli_desk]]

:: desk_music_2

<img src="images/locations/eli_desk.jpeg" alt="Eli's Desk" class="location-image">

Something faster this time. I queue up a track I've been coming back to lately   the kind with a beat that hits somewhere behind the sternum. I turn it up louder than I should.

<<eli "Yeah, that's the one.">>

I sit there nodding to it like an idiot in an empty room. Don't care.

[[← Desk|eli_desk]]

:: desk_music_3

<img src="images/locations/eli_desk.jpeg" alt="Eli's Desk" class="location-image">

I put on an album I used to listen to a lot   years ago, different apartment, different headspace. It sounds the same as it did then, which is strange, because I don't.

<<eli "...takes me back.">>

I sit through most of it without touching anything. Some songs still hit exactly the same.

[[← Desk|eli_desk]]

:: desk_music_4

<img src="images/locations/eli_desk.jpeg" alt="Eli's Desk" class="location-image">

I shuffle something and whatever comes up is loud, aggressive, exactly wrong for the mood I was in going in. I almost skip it. Then I don't. I let it ride.

<<eli "Okay. Okay, fine.">>

By the second track I'm into it. Energy I didn't know I needed.

[[← Desk|eli_desk]]

:: desk_music_5

<img src="images/locations/eli_desk.jpeg" alt="Eli's Desk" class="location-image">

Ambient stuff. No real structure, just texture   layered tones that hum and shift without going anywhere. The room feels different with it on. Bigger, somehow.

<<eli "...this is actually nice.">>

I close my eyes for a minute. Just listen. Doesn't fix anything but makes the air feel less heavy.

[[← Desk|eli_desk]]

:: desk_music_6

<img src="images/locations/eli_desk.jpeg" alt="Eli's Desk" class="location-image">

I can't decide what I want to hear so I just let autoplay do it. Five songs in, something I've never heard before comes on and I actually sit up to check what it is.

<<eli "...who is this.">>

I replay it twice. Add it to a playlist I'll probably never finish building.

[[← Desk|eli_desk]]

:: desk_movie

<<set $rand to random(1, 6)>>
<<if $rand is 1>>
<<goto desk_movie_1>>
<<elseif $rand is 2>>
<<goto desk_movie_2>>
<<elseif $rand is 3>>
<<goto desk_movie_3>>
<<elseif $rand is 4>>
<<goto desk_movie_4>>
<<elseif $rand is 5>>
<<goto desk_movie_5>>
<<else>>
<<goto desk_movie_6>>
<</if>>

:: desk_movie_1

<img src="images/locations/eli_desk.jpeg" alt="Eli's Desk" class="location-image">

I scroll through the library for too long, can't pick anything, and end up rewatching something I've already seen three times. I know how it ends. I watch it anyway.

<<eli "Still good.">>

There's something comfortable about a movie when you already know it. No tension. Just the familiar shape of it.

[[← Desk|eli_desk]]

:: desk_movie_2

<img src="images/locations/eli_desk.jpeg" alt="Eli's Desk" class="location-image">

I put on something I saved months ago and forgot about. Thirty minutes in, I'm actually into it   leaning forward slightly, drink untouched. It's good in that way that sneaks up on you.

<<eli "Okay, this one's actually solid.">>

I make a note to finish it later. I probably won't, but I mean it right now.

[[← Desk|eli_desk]]

:: desk_movie_3

<img src="images/locations/eli_desk.jpeg" alt="Eli's Desk" class="location-image">

Action. Something dumb and loud and entirely without pretension. Explosions, one-liners, a plot that exists mostly as scaffolding for action sequences. I eat it up.

<<eli "Sometimes this is exactly what you need.">>

I'm grinning at the screen like an idiot by the end of the first act. No regrets.

[[← Desk|eli_desk]]

:: desk_movie_4

<img src="images/locations/eli_desk.jpeg" alt="Eli's Desk" class="location-image">

A horror one. I've been putting it off   the kind with a good reputation and a slow build. It starts quiet, almost dull. Twenty minutes in the atmosphere has already gotten under my skin. I turn the room lights up slightly without admitting why.

<<eli "...okay it's a little tense.">>

I finish it. Sleep will be slightly worse tonight. Worth it.

[[← Desk|eli_desk]]

:: desk_movie_5

<img src="images/locations/eli_desk.jpeg" alt="Eli's Desk" class="location-image">

I start a movie and fall asleep forty minutes in. I wake up with the credits rolling and absolutely no memory of what happened after the first act. I sit there trying to reconstruct the plot from the bits I caught.

<<eli "...I have no idea what just happened.">>

I close the tab. Maybe I'll rewatch it when I'm actually awake.

[[← Desk|eli_desk]]

:: desk_movie_6

<img src="images/locations/eli_desk.jpeg" alt="Eli's Desk" class="location-image">

Something older   a film I saw once as a kid and remembered wrong. It's quieter than I remember. Slower. Less about plot, more about just watching people exist on screen. I'm not sure I get all of it.

<<eli "...I feel like I was supposed to understand more of that.">>

I sit with it for a minute after it ends. Something about it sticks.

[[← Desk|eli_desk]]